      "data": {
        "title": "Load the sample data",
        "body": "There are **32 ** records for World Heritage Sites in the UK** (UNESCO IDs licensing CC-BY-SA 3.0 IGO)**.\nThe data has been downloaded in XML and transformed to a CSV format.\nThe **Description** field contains a useful sample to text two modes of LLM inference - **Extraction **and **Interpretation**.\n**Load Selected** to bring the data into a Table and tick the **Show all columns** checkbox."
