      },
      "data": {
        "title": "Adding 'Gold Standard' reference notes",
        "body": "In order to check the performance of the LLM on the task we set, we need to provide a '**gold standard**' examples to test against'.\nFind a few records (5-6), and input what a correct extraction should look like. In this instance we are using a JSON format to capture:\n- place\n- period_or_data\n- site_type\n- nation\n\nWith the original **Description ** field displayed, we can record our ideal extraction content in the **Note ** field below\n"
      },
